These are the verbatim, LF pg_dump schema goldens from v1.3.0.
Refresh to the previous released minor on EVERY release (replace v1.3.0 below):

mkdir -p backend/tools/migrationdiff/testdata/prev-release/v1.3.0
for f in $(git ls-tree --name-only v1.3.0 backend/tools/migrationdiff/golden/); do git show v1.3.0:$f > backend/tools/migrationdiff/testdata/prev-release/v1.3.0/$(basename $f); done

Run the commands from the repository root.
Old pods keep writing during rolling upgrades; the integration tests compare these
columns with the CURRENT migrated catalog and replay frozen previous-release writers.
Update the test fixture path and writer snapshots together when advancing the minor.
